   "context": "ship:Kaskhorade",
   "english": "Serving as the heavy multipurpose backbone of the fleets of the various High Houses, the Kaskhorade trades some of the maneuverability of its smaller siblings for greater flexibility; in addition to being a capable warship, it also offers a sizable amount of free cargo and bunk space that allow it to fulfill a wide variety of missions. Along with serving as convoy escorts and fleet warships, these vessels are often used to transport high-ranking members of the High Houses, as they can remain well-defended while outfitted for fast and luxurious travel.",
